        {
          "type": "verdict",
          "code": "stop",
          "word": "Stop",
          "reason": [
            "Blocking conditions hold (",
            {
              "n": "1"
            },
            "); they are listed in the risks below. ",
            {
              "n": "6"
            },
            " of ",
            {
              "n": "10"
            },
            " feasibility criteria pass (",
            {
              "n": "60%"
            },
            "), which is below the Go line (",
            {
              "n": "75%"
            },
            "). We found changes to your numbers (",
            {
              "n": "3"
            },
            ") that take the project to Go. The score is not a probability of success; it is the share of criteria that pass."
          ],
