              " د.أ) is above the largest capital you named (",
              {
                "n": "6,000.000"
              },
              " د.أ): the difference needs an outside source or a change in your numbers."
            ],
            [
              "You chose no outside funding source."
            ],
            [
              "You prefer Sharia-compliant financing, so ask the provider about the contract form and its Sharia supervision before any commitment."
            ]
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "validation_plan",
      "title": "Validation plan",
      "locked": false,
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "text": [
            "A test plan of ",
            {
              "n": "30"
            },
            " days: test the most important assumptions before you spend on them, ranked by how much each moves your profit and how confident you are in it."
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "definitionList",
          "title": [
            "Test ",
            {
              "n": "1"
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "term": [
                "Why"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Your price is ",
                  {
                    "n": "40.000"
                  },
                  " د.أ. Changing it by ",
                  {
                    "n": "20%"
                  },
                  " moves year-one profit by ",
                  {
                    "n": "19,200.000"
                  },
                  " د.أ. Your confidence in it is High."
                ],
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "user",
                  "confidence": "high",
                  "validated": true
                },
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "The test"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Offer the product or service at this price to prospective customers and record who actually agrees to pay."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "Success line"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "The share of those you ask who actually agree to pay, not those who merely like the offer. This is the protocol’s default description; you set the number you will accept before you start."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "If it fails"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Try a second price on a new group."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "Cost"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Your time"
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "definitionList",
          "title": [
            "Test ",
            {
              "n": "2"
            }
          ],
          "items": [
            {
              "term": [
                "Why"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "You forecast ",
                  {
                    "n": "90"
                  },
                  " units a month in month twelve. Changing that by ",
                  {
                    "n": "20%"
                  },
                  " moves year-one profit by ",
                  {
                    "n": "7,200.000"
                  },
                  " د.أ. Your confidence in it is Medium."
                ],
                "provenance": {
                  "source": "user",
                  "confidence": "medium",
                  "validated": false
                },
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "The test"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Collect paid pre-orders from real customers."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "Success line"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "The number of pre-orders against your forecast for month one. This is the protocol’s default description; you set the number you will accept before you start."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
              "term": [
                "If it fails"
              ],
              "definition": {
                "text": [
                  "Revise the sales forecast and run the numbers again."
                ],
                "provenance": null,
                "lowConfidence": false,
                "mark": null
              },
              "tag": null,
              "label": null,
              "url": null
            },
            {
